3579:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   * @brief Set the configuration for a specific layer of the LTDC controller.
3580:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *
3581:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   * This function configures a layer of the LTDC controller with the specified parameters.
3582:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   * It sets the pixel format stride, window positioning, color frame buffer address, auxiliary
3583:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   * frame buffer addresses, buffer length, and line number based on the layer configuration.
3584:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   * It also handles the mirroring configuration for the layer if specified.
3585:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *
3586:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   * @param hltdc Pointer to a LTDC_HandleTypeDef structure that contains
3587:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *              the configuration information for the specified LTDC.
3588:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   * @param Aux0Addr Auxiliary frame buffer address 0 used for certain pixel formats.
3589:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   * @param Aux1Addr Auxiliary frame buffer address 1 used for certain pixel formats.
3590:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   * @param Mirror Specifies the mirroring configuration for the layer. This parameter
3591:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *               can be one of the following values:
3592:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *               @arg LTDC_MIRROR_NONE: No mirroring.
3593:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *               @arg LTDC_MIRROR_HORIZONTAL: Horizontal mirroring.
3594:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *               @arg LTDC_MIRROR_VERTICAL: Vertical mirroring.
3595:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *               @arg LTDC_MIRROR_HORIZONTAL_VERTICAL: Horizontal and vertical mirroring.
3596:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   * @param LayerIdx Index of the layer being configured. This parameter can be one of the following
3597:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *                 @arg LTDC_LAYER_1: Layer 1 of the LTDC.
3598:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *                 @arg LTDC_LAYER_2: Layer 2 of the LTDC.
3599:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *                 Depending on the LTDC hardware, additional layers may be supported.
3600:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *
3601:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   * @note The stride is calculated based on the pixel format of the layer. The pixel format
3602:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *       defines the number of bytes per pixel and hence the stride (the increment from one
3603:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *       pixel to the next in a row of pixels). The function configures the layer window size
3604:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *       and position, as well as the color and auxiliary frame buffer addresses, which are
3605:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *       dependent on the mirroring configuration and pixel format. The buffer length and
3606:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *       frame buffer line number are also set according to the pixel format and layer size.
3607:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *       Mirroring settings are applied by adjusting the frame buffer start address and
3608:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *       enabling the corresponding mirroring bits in the control register.
3609:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *
3610:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *       This function does not return a value as it is a static function used internally within t
3611:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   *        driver.
3612:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_ltdc.c ****   */
